variant.h, variant.cpp and ../../boards/seeed-xiao-afruitnrf52-nrf52840.json are the XIAO nRF52840
board definition and pin map. PlatformIO does not ship them, so they are copied unchanged from the
MeshCore repository (variants/xiao_nrf52 and boards/, commit 0679dbef), which is MIT licensed:

